            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil Dr Sharkface has plunged the world into chaos and stolen all the kittens. It's up to you and up to four of your friends to save the day. Platinum Kill is a fast-paced run-and-gun throwback that mixes classic 16-bit-style action with a few modern tricks and never takes itself too seriously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through seven stages of relentless enemies, gnarly mid-bosses, and giant screen-filling end bosses. The enemies are plentiful, the mid-bosses occasional, and the end bosses huge and imposing (except for the cat boss, he’s just adorable).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 to 5-player local co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 7 unique levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 unique weapons with multiple variations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Retro pixel art visuals with a chip-tune soundtrack that slaps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil Dr Sharkface has plunged the world into chaos and stolen all the kittens. It's up to you and up to four of your friends to save the day. Platinum Kill is a fast-paced run-and-gun throwback that mixes classic 16-bit-style action with a few modern tricks and never takes itself too seriously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through seven stages of relentless enemies, gnarly mid-bosses, and giant screen-filling end bosses. The enemies are plentiful, the mid-bosses occasional, and the end bosses huge and imposing (except for the cat boss, he’s just adorable).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 to 5-player local co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 7 unique levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 unique weapons with multiple variations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Retro pixel art visuals with a chip-tune soundtrack that slaps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
